'''Legs for Days''' (ビューティフルレッグス, ''Byūtifuru Reggusu'', '''Beautiful Legs''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Knockback" Effect UP (Sm): Knockback distance increases by 10%.

